### Recorrido completo contra docker compose (REST Client de VS Code / JetBrains HTTP Client)

@auth = http://localhost:3001
@catalog = http://localhost:3002
@order = http://localhost:3003

### 1. Login del admin semilla
# @name admin
POST {{auth}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@mini-ecommerce.dev", "password": "Admin123!" }

### 2. Crear producto (solo admin)
# @name producto
POST {{catalog}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Café de altura 500 g", "description": "Tostado medio", "sku": "CAF-500", "category": "cafe", "price": 189.5, "stock": 10 }

### 3. Registro de cliente
# @name cliente
POST {{auth}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@correo.com", "password": "Secreta123!", "name": "Ana" }

### 4. Catálogo público con búsqueda (la segunda vez sale de Redis)
GET {{catalog}}/products?search=café&page=1&limit=10

### 5. Pedido del cliente: descuenta stock y publica order.created
# @name pedido
POST {{order}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "productId": "{{producto.response.body._id}}", "quantity": 2 }] }

### 6. Stock actualizado (caché invalidada por el evento): 8
GET {{catalog}}/products/{{producto.response.body._id}}

### 7. Pedir más de lo que hay → 409 y el stock no cambia
POST {{order}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [{ "productId": "{{producto.response.body._id}}", "quantity": 50 }] }

### 8. Mis pedidos
GET {{order}}/orders?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente.response.body.accessToken}}

### 9. Un cliente no puede crear productos → 403
POST {{catalog}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{cliente.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "sku": "X-001", "price": 1, "stock": 1 }
